{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの食べるなーこ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN31263BVTRPAEC4R0SFB3R","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かき氷って、冬でも食べたくなりますよね!\nきなことお餅がのってるかき氷といちごかき氷が一番好きかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新大久保に行って、ソルファビンを食べたいな〜❁"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てください!\n綺麗な空が撮れました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN313H1F4JSTHBCXRY0JAMS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくきれいじゃないですか?\n絵に書いたみたいな空･*･"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たしか、朝の4時半くらいの空です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに朝早く起きたらいい風景を見られて得した気分です´`*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のなーこは、早寝早起きなのでとても健康的です( ˙▽˙ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも続けていこうっと。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN314QK679F5081XFW9DKSN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nだにーの宝物とツーショット。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}